SUMMARY:Anti-Idling Contest Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Deadline to enter the Contest EXTENDED to APRIL 5\n\nComplete your entry form HERE to join the contest!\n\nThe Wilmette Park District invites all students (High School & younger) to participate in a design competition to raise awareness of vehicle idling and its environmental impact. Create an original design that conveys your own interpretation of anti-idling such as cleaner air for a healthy environment\, saving energy by saving gas\, or whatever it means to YOU! We are looking for artistic creativity—whatever you decide to help spread a message of eliminating waste\, clean air and/or healthy outcomes. \nThe winning design will be featured on banners outside facilities in conjunction with a district-wide anti-idling campaign. \nImportant Dates:\n\nAll design entries must be submitted by Sunday\, April 5 (extended from April 3!).\nThe public will have the opportunity to vote for their favorite designs between April 6 and April 17.\nThe winning design will be announced on Earth Day\, Wednesday\, April 22.\n\nDesign Requirements:\n\nAll designs should be landscape to ensure compatibility.\nDesign should be no smaller than 11”x8.5” and no larger than 36”x24”.\nDesigns should be original and avoid AI-generated content.\nDesigns should be submitted as .jpeg\, .png or .pdf .\n\n\n  \n  Download PDF\n      \n          \n          \n           Save This Page as a PDF
URL:https://wilmettepark.org/event-list/anti-idling-contest-deadline/
LOCATION:Online\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d11ixze0kvt635.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/10121255/AntiIdlingContest-Fi.jpg
END:VEVENT
