SUMMARY:Spring Ice Show Ticket Sales
DESCRIPTION:Ticket Sales BEGIN for the 2026 Spring Ice Show\nAcross the Universe\nCome one\, come all to another exciting and inspiring Spring Ice Show with our talented skaters!\nPerformances: \n\nMay 8 at 7 pm\nMay 9 at 4 pm\nMay 10 at 2 pm\n\nEnjoy our annual show at Centennial Ice Rinks (2300 Old Glenview Rd.) and cheer on our skaters as they showcase their talents on the ice. Ticket sales begin April 6. Contact Florence Krieger for more info: fkrieger@wilpark.org \n\nTickets: $12 general seating\nTicket link coming soon!\n\n\n  \n  Download PDF\n      \n          \n          \n           Save This Page as a PDF
