SUMMARY:Halim Time & Glass Museum
DESCRIPTION:Mallinckrodt Outing: Halim Time & Glass Museum\nThursday\, April 9\, 10:30 am-3 pm\n\nM-$52/NM-$65\nRegistration Code: 431583-01\nDepart from Mallinckrodt Center\n\nTravel to Evanston’s Halim Time & Glass Museum for a guided tour of their stunning collection of clocks\, stained glass and decorative art. We’ll enjoy a catered lunch at the museum following the tour.\n\n\n\n  \n  Download PDF\n      \n          \n          \n           Save This Page as a PDF
