SUMMARY:Spring Garden Preparation Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Spring Garden Preparation Workshop\n\nDate: April 12\nLocation: Mallinckrodt Center\nTime: Noon-1 pm\nAge: 16 & up\nFee: None\, just register with Spring+Summer program registration!!\nRegistration: 450002-01\n\n\nGet your garden ready for a successful growing season! We’ll cover the essential steps for healty plants\, such as HOW TO: \n\nPrepare and improve your soil\nAdd nutrients to boost plant health\nPlan for spring temperature changes\nSelect the right site for your garden\n\nPlus\, how gardening choices and the local environment influence plant health and success! \n\n\n  \n  Download PDF\n      \n          \n          \n           Save This Page as a PDF
URL:https://wilmettepark.org/event-list/garden-workshop/
LOCATION:Mallinckrodt Center\, 1041A Ridge Rd.\, Wilmette\, IL\, 60091\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events,Sustainability
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d11ixze0kvt635.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/20141817/GP26-Fi.jpg
