SUMMARY:Earth Day at Keay
DESCRIPTION:Earth Day at Keay\n\nSaturday\, April 18\, 10 am-Noon\nAt Keay Nature Center\, northeast corner of Hibbard Rd. & Skokie Blvd.\nFree family event\n\nCelebrate Earth Day at Keay with a family nature walk\, activities\, snacks and more! No RSVP needed. \nThis is a free\, drop-in event\, and activities & snacks are available while supplies last between 10 am and Noon. Parking is limited – please plan ahead to walk\, bike\, or travel from the Community Recreation Center or surrounding neighborhood. \nThis is an outdoor event; please dress appropriately for the weather! \n\n  \n  Download PDF\n      \n          \n          \n           Save This Page as a PDF
