SUMMARY:Footloose Audition Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Audition for the Wilmette Children’s Theater’s 2026 Summer Theater Intensive!\nFootloose The Musical \nCasting call for our Summer Theater Intensive at the historic Wallace Bowl in Gillson Park! High Schoolers and rising 8th Graders are welcome to audition for our outdoor production of Footloose! The Musical. Dive into character development\, text analysis\, table work\, music theory and dance curriculum. Performances run: Thursdays-Sundays\, 7/16-7/26. \n\nAudition Registration: 213099-01\n*DEADLINE EXTENDED—register & submit your audition by April 24!\n\nProgram fee upon casting: R-$730/NR-$913. Email wilmettechildrenstheater@wilpark.org for more info. \n\n  \n  Download PDF\n      \n          \n          \n           Save This Page as a PDF
